    "roles": ["band_member", "bandleader", "session", "educator"],
    "summary": "American drummer of Journey (1978-85, and again 1995-98 and 2015-20) and leader of the fusion band Vital Information since 1983, after Jean-Luc Ponty's Enigmatic Ocean (1977). A Berklee-trained jazz player who brought an R&B groove to arena rock: the kick pushed off the \"and\"s, the toms answering the backbeat, the hat foot under the ride. Modern Drummer's readers' No. 1 All-Around Drummer five years running; its Hall of Fame, 2002."
  },
